TITLE:: ProbeLevelsSource
summary:: Peak and RMS measurement source powered by SendPeakRMS
categories:: GUI>Visuals
related:: Classes/ProbeBroker, Classes/ProbeMeter, Classes/ProbeHistory

DESCRIPTION::
ProbeLevelsSource encapsulates the audio server analysis Synth (using code::SendPeakRMS.kr::) and OSC message responder for a given audio bus. It maintains bounded arrays of current peak levels, RMS levels, and peak-hold states, as well as a rolling circular history.

Notifications to consumer callbacks are coalesced on AppClock to prevent overloading the GUI event loop.

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
Instantiates a new ProbeLevelsSource (normally managed automatically by link::Classes/ProbeBroker::).

ARGUMENT:: server
The target link::Classes/Server::.

ARGUMENT:: busType
code::\outputs::, code::\inputs::, or code::\bus::.

ARGUMENT:: busIndex
Audio bus index.

ARGUMENT:: numChannels
Number of channels to analyze.

ARGUMENT:: updateFreq
Telemetry frame rate in Hz.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: peakLevels
FloatArray containing the most recent unwindowed sample peak values.

METHOD:: rmsLevels
FloatArray containing the most recent RMS amplitude values.

METHOD:: peakHoldLevels
FloatArray containing peak-hold values.

METHOD:: resetPeakHold
Resets peak-hold values to current peak levels.

METHOD:: history
Bounded circular history buffer of recent measurement frames.

METHOD:: isRunning
Boolean indicating if the analysis Synth and OSC responder are currently running.
